     On success, function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__AATT__ssttrriinngg() returns the created attribute
     descriptor.  In case of an error, function ddwwaarrff__aadddd__AATT__ssttrriinngg() returns
     DW_DLV_BADADDR and sets the argument _e_r_r.

